  "adaptation": {
    "semantic": "\"stress\": the worry sense, the importance sense, the force on part of a word, and physical force are often different words in other languages. A word borrowed from English may cover only the worry sense.",
    "grammar": "\"stress\": in the worry sense it is usually uncountable: *a lot of stress*, *under stress*, not *a stress*.",
